    <div class="intro-content the-economy">
        <p class="icon-type-label icon-type-news-release">News Release</p>

        <h1 itemprop="name">Philadelphia Fed&rsquo;s Paulson: Tariffs Will Not Leave Lasting Imprint on Inflation</h1>


        <p class="article-date-published" itemprop="datePublished">13 Oct ’25</p>

        <p class="intro-excerpt" itemprop="description">Anna Paulson laid out her her first economic outlook since becoming President and CEO of the Philadelphia Fed at the annual meeting of the National Association for Business Economics in Philadelphia.</p>

        <div class="article-intro-footer">

            <div>


            </div>



        </div>


    </div>

</div>

